Run tests

Usage: souc-linux-x86_64 test [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]  Path to test files or directory [default: .]

Options:
  -f, --filter <FILTER>
          Filter tests by name pattern
      --include-ignored
          Include ignored tests
      --ignored
          Only run ignored tests
  -j, --jobs <JOBS>
          Number of parallel threads (0 = auto) [default: 0]
      --fail-fast
          Fail fast on first failure
      --bench
          Run benchmarks instead of tests
      --list
          List tests without running
      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format (pretty, compact, json, junit) [default: pretty]
      --coverage
          Enable coverage tracking
      --coverage-output <COVERAGE_OUTPUT>
          Coverage output file
  -v, --verbose
          Verbose output
  -h, --help
          Print help
